GFX distributes target-specific SDL3 and SDL3_ttf static artifacts. Their
notices and those of bundled SDL_ttf dependencies are kept in the Licenses
directory. GFX.Audio owns the separately distributed SDL3_mixer artifacts.

GFX.Scene3D includes generated RGBA16F tone-mapping lookup tables derived from
the Blender OpenColorIO color-management data identified alongside the assets.
